# ── UK PLATFORM ROUTE DEPRECATION (2026-05-27, PR #3) ───────────────────────
# Kill the /uk/{city}/{service}/{platform} doorway-page pattern.
# This route generated ~450 templated URLs (15 dynamic cities × 6 services
# × ~5 platforms) that delivered 1 click in 90 days while consuming crawl
# budget that should go to US pages.
#
# Redirect strategy: preserve city + service intent, drop only the platform
# specificity. Mirrors the US ecommerce migration pattern below (one level
# of URL collapse to the parent intent).
#
# NOTE: This is the FIRST placeholder rule in this file. Cloudflare Pages
# _redirects supports :placeholder syntax per their docs. If this rule
# fails to activate on first deploy, fall back to the 90 explicit rules
# documented in audit-current-state/16_uk_framework_b_plus_plan_2026-05-27.md.
/uk/:city/:service/:platform   /uk/:city/:service   301

